,rDialogue: 2,0:01:44.18,0:01:44.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:01:44.21,0:01:44.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.25,0:01:45.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 2,0:01:44.28,0:01:45.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:01:44.32,0:01:45.41,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.35,0:01:45.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:01:44.39,0:01:45.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,pDialogue: 2,0:01:44.42,0:01:45.58,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,!Dialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:44.71,0:01:45.71,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,StartDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.41,0:01:45.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,meDialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 3,0:01:45.58,0:01:46.37,Karaoke,,0,0,0,fx,up!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:56.44,Title,,0,0,250,,Vital Response Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Franky, I want to tell you something while we have a chance. Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.68,0:02:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.68,0:02:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, we can't do anything until we find that No. 2 key?!Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:23.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's right.Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.24,0:02:25.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How stupid!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.49,0:02:28.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, at least I know what's going on.Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm really angry now!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He sure is tough. He's up now.Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.47,0:02:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay there and watch.Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky...Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.02,0:02:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Destroyer Cannon!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow!Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:03:02.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! I don't like this attack because it dislocates my joints!Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! You shouldn't do it, then!Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:06.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a moron.Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:12.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a Six Powers master. Cannonballs would never hit me!Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:15.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you run around,Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you can't escape from my Franky Destroyer Cannon...Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.55,0:03:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because it's got homing cannonballs! Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.30,0:03:27.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Homing cannonballs?! Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:31.81,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Could it be that the cannonballs sense the enemy and follow them?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.82,0:03:45.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of such technology!Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:47.28,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck is he?Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.23,0:03:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it!Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's you who homes in on the enemy?! Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.67,0:04:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You jerk! Hold it!Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:05.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I fell for it! That bastard! Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He disappeared again.Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you hiding?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use searching for me.Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm an expert at Shave, one of the Six Powers.Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:28.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In addition to my lightning speed,Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:33.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I make no noise when moving about, just like owls when they hunt.Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.83,0:04:37.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I execute perfect assassinations. Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An owl, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.01,0:04:50.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My target won't see me until the very moment I kill him. Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:51.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:54.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was hiding here.Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.27,0:05:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like that attack caught you completely off guard, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How impertinent!Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.82,0:05:04.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never experienced such humiliation!Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.72,0:05:07.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a CP9 assassin! Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.53,0:05:09.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.74,0:05:13.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.75,0:05:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Watch out!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! We're above the sea!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is terrible!Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:44.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he gets swept away...Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he'll be headed straight to the basin of the waterfall!Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:49.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since he's in the sea, I can't rescue him. Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky! Hang in there!Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.67,0:06:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can use Moon Walk if I get pulled into the waterfall.Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad! I can't get out of the undertow! Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:09.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a strong current! I can't keep holding my breath, either!Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.26,0:06:11.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to get to the surface, no matter what! Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:14.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sink deeper! Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.27,0:06:20.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That voice! Don't tell me he broke the fridge door!Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:29.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a feast! Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.22,0:06:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on! He got fatter! Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.32,0:06:35.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how much food in that fridge did you eat?! Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna drown in a place like this!Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! I'm almost at the basin of the falls!Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll die! I'll die! I'm falling! Ahhh!Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.31,0:06:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Butterfly!Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away! Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tough Dugong! Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.42,0:07:24.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:35.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paper Art!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.34,0:07:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slime!Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! What the hell was that?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.15,0:07:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, so close!Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:53.45,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is really bad.Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:55.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I've just gotta get to the shore! Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:08:00.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,1.0 Cola Cannon! Coup de Boo!Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:06.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you learned your lesson? Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.29,0:08:09.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It takes more than just strength to defeat a Six Powers master!Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:11.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong Hammer!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paper Art.Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fall into the falls!Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong Right!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come with me! Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go of me, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:49.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk with just one leg can't support two people!Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fall!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, seems like it.Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.51,0:08:59.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So why don't you bring both of us back to the shore before we fall?Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or do you wanna try fighting me while supporting our weight?Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.27,0:09:09.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I might win, Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:12.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but my life would be in danger, too. Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:18.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're certainly in the same boat. Take us back to the shore. Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good job, good job.Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.58,0:09:28.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the shore together. Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it looks like I'll win the fight once we get there! Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:36.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? You think so?Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, because I just thought of a way to finish you off with just one blow.Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.66,0:09:49.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? So did I, Fukuro-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.78,0:09:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, what're you gonna do?Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.99,0:10:00.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take me to the shore already so that I can knock you out!Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.78,0:10:06.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me! I'll shut you up right here, right now!Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.96,0:10:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super Cartwheel Iron Ball!Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.47,0:10:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll slam you into the corner of the tower using this momentum!Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:22.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. It indeed looks like I'll get smashed into pieces.Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.55,0:10:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky Centaur!Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:30.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got both your legs!Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now you can't move however you want in the air! Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?! That still can't stop this momentum! Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:41.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not totally true.Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.87,0:10:49.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,70mm 0.2 Cola Cannon! A bit of Coup de Vent!Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:53.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! I lost my momentum! Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.24,0:10:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You stopped the cartwheel! Damn you! Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.11,0:11:00.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this is enough! We're already above the shore!Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:02.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, take this!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,70mm 1.5 Max Cola Power!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coup de...Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:10.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:17.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give up already, you bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.94,0:11:19.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coup de...Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vent!Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isn't the No. 2 key here yet?Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro-kun! This is it for me! I'm exhausted.Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carry me on your back.Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:48.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would I?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick.Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.23,0:11:59.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:01.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.11,0:12:06.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just aimed at me while pretending to attack those two, didn't you?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a false accusation, but if you want, we can fight.Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:12.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been frustrated for a while now that you've been in my way.Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?! That's what I wanna say, you stupid herbivore!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I'd have to say I prefer meat.Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.57,0:12:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll play rock-paper-scissors, Sogeking.Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.97,0:12:25.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– What? – The problem is these handcuffs.Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's a way to get them off of us.Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll cut off the hand of the loser.Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:37.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with you coming up with such a scary idea looking so serious?! Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:40.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not done! Keep listening! Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:42.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So the one who gets the handcuffs off like that...Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:46.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will hurry to Chopper with their cut-off hand...Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and have Chopper reconnect it to their wrist!Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not stuffed animals! Don't be ridiculous!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:58.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got another idea.Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.43,0:13:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh! Ahh! I don't wanna hear it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.99,0:13:05.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of arguing.Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:10.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can start anytime. The winner can keep the prey all to himself. Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.19,0:13:20.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hm? – What's that? Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:35.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, Sogeking. Don't lose your posture.Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:38.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are a sword!Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:44.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone get me a lawyer! I'll sue you for sure!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone with as little self-discipline as him. Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he gained that much weight in just a few minutes alone. Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:12.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't... need to be... need to be... need to be...Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not concerned! Just speak normally!Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.65,0:14:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's “need to be concerned”, right?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:19.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I was... I was... I was...Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got it, so you can cut that out!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, there's no need to be concerned, then?Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.55,0:14:30.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back here!Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was... I was... That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:37.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As for why,Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.10,0:14:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just watch! Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.90,0:14:41.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vital Response! Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.14,0:14:46.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Digest!Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Absorb!Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:52.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm back to normal!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! What?! What are you?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you just do?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.37,0:15:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do it again.Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vital Response!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.75,0:15:04.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Digest!Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.54,0:15:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Absorb!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.05,0:15:13.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're amazing! How does that work?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.88,0:15:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Glad you asked!Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A thousand years at sea, and a thousand years in the mountains...Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:24.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Breathing in the wind and drinking dewdrops,Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I trained myself, living as a hermit!Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:33.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all that, I've... I've... I've... I've acquired this “Vital Response”! Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.90,0:15:39.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essentially, if you extend your consciousness everywhere,Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from your hair to your internal organs, toes, even the tip of your downy hair,Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:50.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there's no part of your body that you can't manipulate.Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.02,0:15:54.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Extending your consciousness even to the tip of your hair?Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.39,0:15:57.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've read about that kind of ability in a book before.Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's called something like biofeedback. Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.52,0:16:04.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then your hair moves around like an octopus because of that ability?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An octopus?! How terribly rude!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Call me... a valiant...Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:24.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lion... will... will you?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why does it matter which one?Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vital Response!Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.92,0:16:31.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hair Bind!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.85,0:16:45.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.36,0:16:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If those catch me, I'm done for! Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol: Cue!Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That stick doesn't even have a pointed tip! Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:11.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cue! Cue! Cue!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heavy Gong!Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:15.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.19,0:17:27.49,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.49,0:17:32.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,As I thought, he won't budge unless I attack with Arm Point or Horn Point.Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:37.82,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But rumble balls are potent drugs.Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.82,0:17:40.33,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The proper dosage is one every six hours. Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.33,0:17:42.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I take more than that, it'll be a huge strain on my body.Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Plus, the second one will alter the transformation wavelength, Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:51.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and so it'll be hard to control my transformations.Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.13,0:17:55.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,With the third one, I'll lose consciousness and hardly be able to fight.Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.72,0:17:59.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What do I do? I could get stronger if I just take one more. Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.39,0:18:06.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll roast you on a skewer!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.69,0:18:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shishi Kebab!Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:28.41,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just wasting time like this! Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.41,0:18:29.54,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Rumble!Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:33.20,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The risk is high, but I have a chance! Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:35.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,It's now all or nothing! Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:38.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll somehow finish this within three minutes! Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take this!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Horn Point!Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:44.47,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Wrong one!Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.47,0:18:46.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow! Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kebab!Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.94,0:18:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jumping Point!Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:55.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Wrong one!Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:15.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,As I feared, I can't control my transformations. Dammit! Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:17.76,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If only I could somehow use Arm Point,Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:21.28,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I could hit him with a full-powered Cloven attack! Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:24.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The fire is spreading, making this room more dangerous. Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.26,0:19:29.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no time for me to be stuck with a guy with no key on him!Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.22,0:19:33.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd better hurry up and get the No. 2 key...Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:36.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,and free Zoro and Sogeking!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.98,0:19:40.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Or we can't rescue Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:45.38,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! Robin! Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.03,0:19:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm...Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm fighting in order to save our friend!Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a tough animal!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vital Response!Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His hair took the form of hands! Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to do it! I can't be defeated in a place like this!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.78,0:20:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm their only hope!Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shishi Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:38.60,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Galaxy 9000  Timing: Galaxy 9000  Quality Control: danpmss, Honoka, Galaxy 9000, Grug, Pepperjack  Soundtracking:  Halee  Graphics:  Datenshi  Karaoke: KaitouYahiko  Translation: Crunchyroll, Gaijin